---
import CloseModalBtn from "./CloseModalBtn.astro";
---

<div class="project-details">
  <h2>OneTouch</h2>

  <p>
    OneTouch is a dynamic platform dedicated to creating custom marketing
    campaigns leveraging Salesforce Marketing Cloud. The project empowers
    clients by delivering tailored digital marketing solutions that drive
    engagement and measurable results.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
    Company: Globant | LifeScan IP Holdings, LLC <br />
    Role: Web UI Developer <br />
    Period: August 2022 – December 2022
  </p>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Technical Overview</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Frontend Development:</strong> Developed using JavaScript, HTML, and
      CSS to build a responsive and interactive interface for creating custom campaigns.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Salesforce Marketing Cloud Integration:</strong> Integrated with Salesforce
      Marketing Cloud to offer robust campaign management, automated triggers, and
      detailed analytics.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Team Collaboration:</strong> Collaborated with an intermediate frontend
      developer and a Salesforce specialist to ensure technical excellence and a
      seamless integration process.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Development Process</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Requirement Analysis & Planning:</strong> Gathered client requirements
      and planned the campaign customization features to align with their marketing
      strategies.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Implementation:</strong> Developed custom frontend components to revamp
      the original page content for targeted marketing strategies, ensuring seamless
      user interactions and a fully responsive design built with JavaScript, HTML,
      and CSS.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Integration & Testing:</strong> Coordinated with the Salesforce specialist
      to integrate Marketing Cloud functionalities and rigorously tested the system
      for reliability.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Client Collaboration:</strong> Held weekly meetings with the client
      to report progress, gather feedback, and analyze campaign results, ensuring
      continuous improvement and alignment with client goals.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <p class="mb-4">Key Skill: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Salesforce.</p>

  <p>
    OneTouch stands as a testament to my capacity to deliver innovative,
    user-focused solutions using modern frontend technologies. My work on this
    project highlights my proficiency in developing responsive, interactive
    interfaces with JavaScript, HTML, and CSS, and demonstrates my ability to
    collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams while maintaining clear
    and consistent client communication.
  </p>

  <a
    class="button--primary mt-10"
    href="https://www.onetouch.com/"
    target="_blank">Project website</a
  >

  <CloseModalBtn />
</div>
